Description: Lugh desktop shell
 The shell of the Lugh desktop: top bar, dock, launcher, notifications,
 control center, on-screen displays, lock screen and polkit agent, as one
 Qt 6 / QML process on a Wayland compositor with wlr-layer-shell.
 .
 Started by the lugh-session.target systemd user unit (package lugh-session).
